Derived material and how it was changed:

  tool/upstream_registry.json
      The rule catalog extracted verbatim from Impeccable's
      crates/foundation/src/registry.rs, including rule ids, categories,
      severities, names and descriptions. Unmodified content.

  detector/lib/src/registry.dart
      24 of the 36 rules carry over Impeccable rule definitions, each naming
      its source id in the `portOf` field. Descriptions were rewritten for
      Flutter widgets and Dart source; ids and the slop/quality categories
      follow the originals. The 12 rules in the `platform` category are new.

  detector/lib/src/finding.dart, detector/lib/src/colors.dart
      The finding shape follows Impeccable's foundation::findings::Finding.
      The contrast and luminance helpers follow foundation::color; the WCAG
      formulas themselves are from the W3C specification.

  skills/impeccable-flutter/SKILL.md and reference/
      Structure, command vocabulary and parts of the guidance follow
      Impeccable's skill. Rewritten for Flutter throughout; the live-browser
      commands have no counterpart here and were replaced by
      reference/verify.md.

